{"id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-pi01class.md","title":"有效闭类及其相对版本","display":"df-pi01class — 有效闭类及其相对版本","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-pi01class"],"depends_on":["[[43-df-tree]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"display":"df-pi01class — 有效闭类及其相对版本","label":"43-df-pi01class","type":"definition","source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.16.1–5.16.2, print pp.62–64 / PDF pp.82–84","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-pi01class</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64d83554d467a24a\" href=\"?note=64d83554d467a24a\" title=\"43-df-tree\">43-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi01class — 有效闭类及其相对版本"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-pi01class"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.16.1–5.16.2, print pp.62–64 / PDF pp.82–84"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree},[T]\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree},[T]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64d83554d467a24a\" href=\"?note=64d83554d467a24a\" title=\"43-df-tree\">43-df-tree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T\">\\(\\chi_T\\)</span> 经串编码解释。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{T,2^{&lt;\\omega}}(\\sigma):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\sigma\\in T,\\\\0,&amp;\\sigma\\notin T.\\end{cases}\\qquad(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_{T,2^{&lt;\\omega}}(\\sigma):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\sigma\\in T,\\\\0,&amp;\\sigma\\notin T.\\end{cases}\\qquad(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}_{2^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}}^A(\\chi_{T,2^{&lt;\\omega}})\\land\\mathcal C=[T]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}_{2^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}}^A(\\chi_{T,2^{&lt;\\omega}})\\land\\mathcal C=[T]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Pi^{0,\\varnothing}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Pi^{0,\\varnothing}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>树判定函数总定义且取0/1；不要求每个节点均可扩成无限路径。相对有效闭类仍然是拓扑闭集，不能与任意Π⁰₂类混同。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.16.1–5.16.2, print pp.62–64 / PDF pp.82–84。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"64d83554d467a24a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"64d83554d467a24a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$A\\in\\mathcal O$，$\\operatorname{Tree},[T]$ 见 [[43-df-tree]]，$\\chi_T$ 经串编码解释。 $\\mathcal O$、$\\operatorname{AsSet}$、$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$A\\in\\mathcal O$，$\\operatorname{Tree},[T]$ 见 [[43-df-tree]]，$\\chi_T$ 经串编码解释。 $\\mathcal O$、$\\operatorname{AsSet}$、$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree},[T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{T,2^{<\\omega}}(\\sigma):=\\begin{cases}1,&\\sigma\\in T,\\\\0,&\\sigma\\notin T.\\end{cases}\\qquad(T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega},\\ \\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\ (\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}_{2^{<\\omega},\\{0,1\\}}^A(\\chi_{T,2^{<\\omega}})\\land\\mathcal C=[T]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Pi^{0,\\varnothing}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"baa590d3c0c1f233","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 和公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$P\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]，$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。"},{"id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$E_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 采用 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]] 的有限串代码；$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A$、$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。本节引入相对检验 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A$、相对随机性 $\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A$ 及两个一元低性谓词 $\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}$、$\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}$。"},{"id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$P\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]，$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。"},{"id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]] — 有效闭类及其相对版本"},{"id":"95e37bd44b042dee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 为非空Π⁰₁类，见 [[43-df-pi01class]]。序列与集合按特征函数识别。"},{"id":"d2a7ec8c3ff53d91","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"3990b21717529194","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"5e1e6346289285ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。"},{"id":"cdaa5386fcc6122c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$X_{\\ge n}\\in2^\\omega$ 是下式定义的第 $n$ 个尾序列（$n\\in\\mathbb N$）。有效闭类、随机性及测度见 [[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-measure]]；$\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 及公平硬币测度采用 [[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"2e10c73c7c9608d7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depen